  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into small chunks.\n• Place sweet potato on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6170d8c965200c66cd2223ad/step-7dfdda68.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium saucepan, bring the water (for the rice) to the boil.\n• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt. Stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low. Cook for 10 mins, then remove pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6170d8c965200c66cd2223ad/step-c0335468.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. Roughly chop Asian greens. Trim the green beans then slice in half. Zest the lime to get a pinch.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook green beans until softened, 3-4 minutes. Add garlic and Malaysian spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Stir in vegetable stock, soy sauce, lime zest, coconut milk, brown sugar and simmer until thickened, 4 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6170d8c965200c66cd2223ad/step-fc2b25cf.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice lime into wedges.\n• Add Asian greens to curry and stir until wilted, 1-2 mins. Stir in roast veggies. Remove from heat and add a generous squeeze of lime. Season to taste.\n• Divide rice and veggie curry between bowls. Sprinkle with peanuts. Serve with any remaining lime wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6170d8c965200c66cd2223ad/step-bcef04db.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
